# Video Generate AI

A lightweight AI-style video generation web app prototype built with Node.js and Express.

This project generates a short MP4 from a text prompt using a local ffmpeg pipeline. It is designed as a practical MVP for a video generation product and can be extended with real AI providers such as Runway, Replicate, Stability, or OpenAI image/video APIs.

## Features

- Text-to-video prompt form
- Style selection: cinematic, nature, futuristic, fantasy, product
- Duration control
- MP4 export with a generated preview
- Simple express-based UI

## Tech stack

- Node.js
- Express
- ffmpeg-static

## Getting started

1. Install dependencies:

   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

2. Start the app:

   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

3. Open:

   ```text
   http://localhost:3000
   ```

## Notes

- The app uses a local ffmpeg pipeline to create a stylized MP4 video from your prompt.
- To extend it into a real AI video platform, connect providers like Replicate, Stability, Pika, or Runway and store generated assets in cloud storage.

